How known VPN, proxy and circumvention apps run on Android (their modes, local proxy ports, password
options and UDP support), collected by the Datapavan project from each app's own source code and
documentation, and dedicated to the public domain under CC0 1.0
(https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/). Recorded in ADR 0015 and DESIGN.md 13.2.
